meta {
  name: Log Out
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/logout
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Post Log Out
  
  This authentication request is used to sign out from application or reset current session. This request interacts with the MySQL database.
  
  ## Responses
  
  **200 — Logout success**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Logout success"
  }
  ```
  
  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
  ```
  
  **500 — Internal Server Error**
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
  ```
}
